// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1934706827" "This realm is in itself a work of art.<em>And to think... it was created by those whom I've helped to create. Spectacular!"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4173159429" "So THIS is where the apparitions fled... and THEY are why this place has come to be."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3905130773" "I truly owe her everything. In fact, this entire realm is in her debt.<em>It would be MADNESS to think otherwise!"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2427467651" "Many of the apparitions here... I once knew as people.<em>Some I even helped to create.<em>I like to think that they are still in there... somewhere."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3504165398" "It's nice to escape, to slip away on occasion... to be rid of the incessant, intrusive voices.<em>I often come here for peace of mind."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3946311086" "Isn't this place beautiful? ...just as I had envisioned.<em>It's truly amazing the amount of detail I can pull from the minds of others."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3663992969" "The apparitions here...filled with such unbridled hate and loathing. But it was not always so.<em>I try to remember them as they once were."

// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2865649524" "Without further adieu..."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P969710443" "Alas, friends, we must part ways..."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2581426080" "All good things, my friends..."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_DREAM_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3237257716" "I must leave for now.<em>Safe travels."

// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2903306599" "Yes! YES!! Your FEARS yield beautiful colors!"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3639129468" "There is NO following of dreams! NO escaping of nightmares!"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3474282298" "Rejoice! As your greatest fears become my MASTERPIECE!!!"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P397371559" "You fear in colors inconceivable to the bare mind..."

// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P941839789" "Ah! The final hue steps forward to complete my masterpiece..."
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3247688657" "What's THIS!? New FEARS by which to paint?"
// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_NIGHT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4269849566" "Another waker sleeps!<em>Come hither, child... and become a WORK OF ART!!!"

// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_CAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3845934736" "The darkness... is... BLINDING!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_CAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2480671011" "Please, no...no...No! AAAHHHHHHH!!!"
// NIGHTWARD_DEAD_CAPTURED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3595360078" "I can't... I Can't! AHHHHAHAHAAHAAA!!!"

// NIGHTWARD_MALAISE_BOOGEY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P564722566" "People always treat me like I'm the boogeyman...<em>Not That I don't like to boogey!!"

